# ZooKeeper at e=3 (owner 2026-11-09 07:00: use the free capacity): the Opus Java port's exports at (3,0) and (3,1), the Opus Rust port's export at (3,0) (its 48 h run on volta01 timed out), S_raft at e=3 (the omnipaxos spec program at (3,1,1), as sraft-e1/e2 are its (1,1,1)/(2,1,1) exports), and the joins. brain12, no time limit.
# S_zab at e=3 and the Rust port at (3,1) were exported on volta02 and copied to this node's imports.
C3E.omnipaxos.spec_correct_3_1_1_fifo.t16.cinf 250 8640000 "$DAAVAR"/scripts/rust-run.sh omnipaxos export spec --out export.jsonl --threads 16 --model fifo -- correct 3 1 1
C3E.zookeeper-zab-rust.impl_3_0_fifo.t16.cinf 250 8640000 "$DAAVAR"/scripts/rust-run.sh zookeeper-zab-rust export impl --out export.jsonl --threads 16 --model fifo -- 3 0
C3J.zookeeper-zab-rust.impl_3_0_fifo.vs-hand.cinf.m 250 8640000 needok:C3E.zookeeper-zab-rust.impl_3_0_fifo.t16.cinf,C3E.omnipaxos.spec_correct_3_1_1_fifo.t16.cinf "$EVAL_OUT"/tf-merge-target/release/conf-join --merge "$EVAL_OUT"/C3E.omnipaxos.spec_correct_3_1_1_fifo.t16.cinf/export.jsonl "$EVAL_OUT"/C3E.zookeeper-zab-rust.impl_3_0_fifo.t16.cinf/export.jsonl
